  Relative to these, the MC‑DML paper has comparably strong empirical gains on its chosen benchmark and solid clarity, but it is weaker on experimental thoroughness (compute normalization, baseline design) and a bit more over-claimy about efficiency. It feels somewhat below the 7–7.5 anchor and closer to the 6–6.5 band.

