Placing MC‑DML relative to these, it sits between the strong medium band (~5) and the solid high band (6–7). Its Jericho results are impressive enough to justify acceptance, but the lack of compute-normalized comparisons and somewhat underpowered LLM baselines keep it below the best planning papers with scores ≥7.

